check=collision-free-tree
operator=case-variant-addition
mutation=enumerate | test/spec/Live/ObjectReconcilerSpec.hs
statement=Restore a pair of enumerated paths that differ only by case. Two of the four substrates
statement=reach the tree case-insensitively, so the pair is one path there and one side silently
statement=overwrites the other. The mutation is on the enumeration rather than on disk because a
statement=case-insensitive filesystem cannot hold the pair to begin with — which is the defect,
statement=not an obstacle to seeding it.
